---
description: Website and frontend rules
globs: ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.ts", "**/*.jsx", "**/*.js", "app/**", "components/**", "src/**", "pages/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Reuse existing UI primitives before creating new ones.
- Keep components small, composable, and visually consistent.
- Preserve accessibility basics: landmarks, labels, focus states, keyboard paths.
- Prefer readable Tailwind and simple composition over clever abstractions.
- Optimize for clean layout, responsive behavior, and obvious visual hierarchy.
- Avoid unnecessary animation, libraries, or state managers.
